gramming language that brings improvements across the board including core library APIs, builds, debugging, interoperability with other platforms, and performance.\",\"page_last_modified\":1790121600},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/swift-library/swift-benchmark/blob/HEAD/Documentation/Decisions/PreflightImplementationDecisions.md\",\"title\":\"swift-library/swift-benchmark - Documentation/Decisions/PreflightImplementationDecisions.md\",\"snippet\":\"- Local Swift toolchain: `Apple Swift version 6.3.1`. ... - Current public products: `Instruments` and transitional `SignpostMacros`. ... - Current targets: `Instruments`, `InstrumentsMacro`,\",\"page_last_modified\":1791187712},{\"url\":\"https://wiki.openstack.org/wiki/Swift/version_map\",\"title\":\"Swift/version map - OpenStack\",\"snippet\":\"Swift/version map - OpenStack\\n Jump to: navigation, search ... Swift versions in OpenStack integrated releases\\nThe change log file for what's in every release is at https://github.com/openstack/swift/blob/master/CHANGELOG\\nDates are taken from the tags in Swift's source repo.\",\"page_last_modified\":-1},{\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/collections/ukisai/swift-15-27b\",\"title\":\"Swift 1.5 27B - a ukisai Collection\",\"snippet\":\"Swift 1.5 27B - a ukisai Collection\\nukisai 's Collections\\nupdated 5 days ago\\nSwift 1.5 on Qwen3.8-27B: stronger than Swift 1.0 on agentic and coding tasks, with fewer thinking tokens. ... Note Swift 1.5 (latest). Full BF16 weights. Start here. ... ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF\",\"page_last_modified\":-1},{\"url\":\"https://gist.github.com/bmaupin/a1585eb29b893ac8d184\",\"title\":\"Install Swift on Ubuntu · GitHub\",\"snippet\":\"Install Swift on Ubuntu · GitHub ... |  | # https://swift.org/download/#using-downloads | ... |  | # Get latest Swift version from https://swift.org/download/ | ... |  | swift_version=4.0.3 |\",\"page_last_modified\":1514707200},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/swiftlang/swift/releases/tag/swift-5.4.3-RELEASE\",\"title\":\"Release Swift 5.4.3 Release · swiftlang/swift · GitHub\",\"snippet\":\"Release Swift 5.4.3 Release · swiftlang/swift · GitHub ... since this release\\nswift-5.4.3-RELEASE\\n`282fe25` ... swift-5.4.3-RELEASE\\nChange version string to 'swift-5.4.3-RELEASE'\",\"page_last_modified\":-1},{\"url\":\"https://github.com/SoundBlaster/SwiftJev\",\"title\":\"SoundBlaster/SwiftJev — Swift framework to access Jev System One model by TypeSafe.ai\",\"snippet\":\"Swift 6.3+](https://img.shields.io/badge/Swift-6.3%2B-orange? ... logo=swift)](https://www.swift.org)\",\"page_last_modified\":1791753728},{\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/807283\",\"title\":\"Swift version wrong in Xcode 26.2 … | Apple Developer Forums\",\"snippet\":\"Created10m\\n\\nReplies0\\n\\nBoosts0\\n\\nViews6\\n\\nParticipants1\\n\\nRelease notes of Xcode 26.2 <https://developer.apple.com/documentation/xcode-release-notes/xcode-26_2-release-notes> ... But when trying to check the Swift version with`#if swift(>= 6.2.3)` it returns false. ... Running `swiftc -version` returns `swift-driver version: 1.127.14.1 Apple Swift version 6.2 (swiftlang-6.2.3.3.2 clang-1700.6.3.2)`\\n\\nAs you can see, there is a mismatch between the *marketing version* \\\"6.2\\\" and the *build version* \\\"6.\",\"page_last_modified\":-1}]}"}},"emittedAtMs":1792210997493}
